{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_11","type":"agent_message","text":"The C surface is small but has two important quirks to preserve: `use_generated` handles only `n = 0..6` (so `7` and all other values return the operation’s initial accumulator), while build-time `REPEAT=7` is valid for the unrolled helper path. I’m running an automated compile matrix for all 24 exact-one-operation/exact-one-repeat combinations before creating artifacts or tests."}}
